  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Consider the following sequence of reactions.</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mi>Alc</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>KOH</mi></mrow></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><munderover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>Conc</mi><mo>.</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mrow></munderover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#39;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></math>&nbsp;is</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\ot3_0005_84b9dd946ea2.png\" style=\"width: 195px; height: 90px;\" /></p>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "None of these",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHOHCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is reacted with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>PCl</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></math>, 2-Chloropropane&nbsp;is formed. Thus, X is 2-Chloropropane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHClCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHOHCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is reacted with alc. KOH , Propene&nbsp;is formed. Thus, Y is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo></math>.</p><p>When <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi>CH</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> is treated with conc. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>SO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>, 2-Propanol <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHOHCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> is formed. Thus Z is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>CHOHCH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p>​​​<p><img src=\"assets\\st0005_a06a73096ed3.png\" style=\"width: 451px; height: 270px;\" /></p>"
  }
